    notes: ["The term of a Managing or Whole-time Director cannot exceed five years at a time (Section 196(2)). The remuneration must be within Section 197 and Schedule V, with members' approval where the Act requires it.", "Check the conditions of Schedule V, Part I (age, residence, disqualification) before the appointment, and file Form DIR-12 within 30 days. The Managing Director is also a Key Managerial Personnel."],
